libkernel TTY stubs: sceTtyInit/sceResetttyinit succeed, sceTtyWrite logs and returns its length, sceTtyRead returns 0.
Why: they were TODO_NAMED placeholders that stop the program; Jackass calls sceTtyInit during start-up (0x1C1368).
On a retail console the DECI2 debug console has no host, and these calls succeed without effect.
Origin: this project (jackass-ps2-recomp), 2026-10-27.

diff --git a/runtime/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/Kernel/Stubs/TTY.cpp b/runtime/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/Kernel/Stubs/TTY.cpp
